{"id":"ics-077","stemHtml":"<p>下面的函数把 8 字节缓冲区&quot;清空&quot;，但循环边界写错了：</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-c\">void f(void) {\n    char buf[8];\n    for (int i = 0; i &lt;= 8; i++)   /* 应该是 i &lt; 8 */\n        buf[i] = 0;\n}</code></pre></p>\n<p>未开启栈保护时，汇编是（<code>buf</code> 位于 <code>%rbp-8</code>）：</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-text\">f:\n    pushq   %rbp\n    movq    %rsp, %rbp\n    subq    $16, %rsp\n    leaq    -8(%rbp), %rax      # buf\n    xorl    %ecx, %ecx\n.L2:\n    movb    $0, (%rax,%rcx)     # buf[i] = 0\n    addq    $1, %rcx\n    cmpq    $8, %rcx\n    jle     .L2                 # i &lt;= 8 时继续\n    leave\n    ret</code></pre></p>\n<p>(1) <code>buf</code> 的地址是 <code>%rbp-8</code>，那么 <code>i = 8</code> 时写到了哪个位置？被改成 0 的是哪一字节？</p>\n<p>(2) 设 <code>0(%rbp)</code> 处保存的旧 <code>%rbp</code> 为 <code>0x00007fffffffe4a0</code>。函数执行 <code>leave</code> 之后 <code>%rbp</code> 变成多少？帧指针移动了多少字节？</p>\n<p>(3) 返回调用者后，调用者继续用自己的 <code>%rbp</code> 访问局部变量和保存的返回地址，会发生什么？为什么这种&quot;帧指针偏移&quot;可能导致控制流被劫持？</p>\n<p>(4) 如果给函数开启 <code>-fstack-protector</code>（编译器把 canary 放在 <code>-8(%rbp)</code>、<code>buf</code> 放到 <code>-16(%rbp)</code>），<code>i = 8</code> 写的就是 canary 的最低字节——为什么 canary 检查发现不了这次越界？</p>\n<p>(5) 从代码、编译选项、检查工具三个角度，各给出一种能防住/发现这个 bug 的办法。</p>\n","hintHtml":"<p>栈向低地址增长，<code>buf[i]</code> 的地址是 <code>buf + i</code>；<code>buf</code> 结束于 <code>%rbp-1</code>，所以 <code>i = 8</code> 正好落在 <code>%rbp</code> 指向的字节上——那是<strong>保存的旧 <code>%rbp</code> 的最低字节</strong>（小端存储时，最低字节在最低地址）。canary 的最低位是编译器特意清零的，所以写入 0 不会改变它。</p>\n","solutionHtml":"<p><strong>(1)</strong> <code>buf</code> 占 <code>%rbp-8</code> 到 <code>%rbp-1</code>（8 字节）。<code>i = 8</code> 时地址是</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\%rbp-8+8=\\%rbp,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9444em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9444em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>也就是 <code>0(%rbp)</code> 这一字节——保存的旧 <code>%rbp</code> 在内存中的<strong>最低字节</strong>（x86-64 小端，低地址存低字节），被写成 <code>0x00</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>为什么想到</strong>：先算出缓冲区覆盖的地址区间，再算 <code>i=8</code> 的偏移；<code>%rbp</code> 处正是「保存的旧帧指针」的第一个字节，而不是返回地址（返回地址在 <code>8(%rbp)</code>）。</p>\n<p><strong>(2)</strong> 旧 <code>%rbp</code> 是 <code>0x00007fffffffe4a0</code>，最低字节是 <code>0xa0</code>；把它改成 <code>0x00</code> 后：</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mtable rowspacing=\"0.25em\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mtext>原值</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">0x00007fffffffe4a0</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mtext>新值</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">0x00007fffffffe400</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mtext>差值</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">0xa0</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>160</mn><mtext> 字节</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\begin{aligned}\n\\text{原值} &amp;= \\texttt{0x00007fffffffe4a0},\\\\\n\\text{新值} &amp;= \\texttt{0x00007fffffffe400},\\\\\n\\text{差值} &amp;= \\texttt{0xa0}=160\\ \\text{字节}.\n\\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.2em;vertical-align:-1.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.51em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">原值</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">新值</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.51em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">差值</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.51em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">0x00007fffffffe4a0</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">0x00007fffffffe400</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.51em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">0xa0</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">160</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<code>leave</code> 等价于 <code>movq %rbp, %rsp; popq %rbp</code>：它从 <code>0(%rbp)</code> 弹出这个被改过的值，于是函数返回后调用者的 <code>%rbp</code> 比正确值<strong>低了 160 字节</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>(3)</strong> 调用者之后的代码全部用 <code>%rbp</code> 作为基准访问自己的局部变量、参数和保存的返回地址。帧指针一错位，这些访问就整体偏移了 160 字节：</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mtable rowspacing=\"0.25em\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mtext>调用者以为的保存位置</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>旧</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mtext>实际读到的位置</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>旧</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>160</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>152</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\begin{aligned}\n\\text{调用者以为的保存位置} &amp;: \\%rbp_{\\text{旧}}+0,\\ +8,\\dots\\\\\n\\text{实际读到的位置} &amp;: \\%rbp_{\\text{旧}}-160,\\ -152,\\dots\n\\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7em;vertical-align:-1.1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.76em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">调用者以为的保存位置</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实际读到的位置</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.76em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">旧</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">旧</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">160</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">152</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>也就是说，调用者的 <code>leave</code> 会从错误的位置弹出旧的 <code>%rbp</code> 和返回地址。若这 160 字节范围内有攻击者能写入的数据（例如被调用函数的缓冲区、或调用者更早读入的输入），攻击者就能让调用者从&quot;自己的数据&quot;里取返回地址，从而劫持控制流。这就是**帧指针偏移（frame shift）**攻击：不需要覆盖返回地址，只改一个字节的 <code>%rbp</code>，把整个调用者的栈帧&quot;挪&quot;到攻击者布置的数据上。</p>\n<p><strong>为什么想到</strong>：单字节只能改 <code>%rbp</code> 的低 8 位，但栈帧的局部变量和返回地址都是相对 <code>%rbp</code> 定位的，<code>%rbp</code> 一动，后续所有相对访问都跟着动——改一个字节就能移动最多 255 字节的&quot;视野&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>(4)</strong> 开栈保护后，布局变成：</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mtable rowspacing=\"0.25em\" columnalign=\"right left right left\" columnspacing=\"0em 1em 0em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>∼</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>:</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">buf</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mtext> 字节</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>∼</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>:</mo><mtext>canary</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>:</mo><mtext>保存的旧 </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>:</mo><mtext>返回地址</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\begin{aligned}\n-16(\\%rbp) &amp;\\sim -9(\\%rbp) &amp;&amp;: \\texttt{buf}\\ (8\\ \\text{字节}),\\\\\n-8(\\%rbp)  &amp;\\sim -1(\\%rbp) &amp;&amp;: \\text{canary},\\\\\n0(\\%rbp)   &amp;                 &amp;&amp;: \\text{保存的旧 }\\%rbp,\\\\\n8(\\%rbp)   &amp;                 &amp;&amp;: \\text{返回地址}.\n\\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:5.7em;vertical-align:-2.6em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.1em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.76em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.76em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.6em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.1em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.76em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.76em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.6em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.1em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.6em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.1em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">buf</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.76em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">canary</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">保存的旧</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.76em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">返回地址</span></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.6em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<code>i = 8</code> 写到 <code>-8(%rbp)</code>，即 canary 的最低字节。编译器生成 canary 时<strong>最低字节被强制为 0x00</strong>（这样字符串函数无法把它当普通字节写回），所以这次写入 <code>0x00</code> 等于<strong>没有改变</strong> canary 的值，函数返回前的比较照样通过，攻击者也就获得了「不触发保护地改变相邻内存一个字节」的能力（这里改的是 canary 自身，若缓冲区紧邻保存的 <code>%rbp</code>，改的就是帧指针）。</p>\n<p><strong>为什么想到</strong>：canary 检查比的是&quot;整个 8 字节是否等于原值&quot;；写入一个与原来相同的字节，差值仍为 0，检查当然发现不了。</p>\n<p><strong>(5)</strong> 三个角度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>代码</strong>：把循环条件改成 <code>i &lt; 8</code>（或用 <code>sizeof(buf)</code>、<code>memset(buf, 0, sizeof buf)</code>），从源头消除 off-by-one；对外部长度做「不小于 0 且不超过容量」的双向检查，注意无符号数下溢。</li>\n<li><strong>编译选项</strong>：<code>-fstack-protector-strong</code> 能让更多函数插入 canary，<code>-D_FORTIFY_SOURCE=2</code> 让 <code>memset</code>/<code>memcpy</code> 在编译期或运行期检查对象大小；但注意本题的 NUL 单字节写<strong>能绕过 canary</strong>，所以不能只依赖 canary。</li>\n<li><strong>检查工具</strong>：AddressSanitizer（<code>-fsanitize=address</code>）用红区（redzone）包住每个栈对象，能精确报出「越界 1 字节」；<code>-Warray-bounds</code>、静态分析器、fuzzing + ASan 也能在测试阶段发现。</li>\n</ul>\n","mistakesHtml":"<p>一是以为 <code>i=8</code> 写的是返回地址——返回地址在 <code>8(%rbp)</code>，<code>i=8</code> 只到 <code>%rbp</code>，改的是保存的旧 <code>%rbp</code>。二是把帧指针偏移量算成 8 或 255：这里是把 <code>0xa0</code> 清零，差值恰好 <code>0xa0=160</code>。三是认为开了 canary 就一定安全：canary 最低字节为 0，写入 0 的 off-by-one 恰好&quot;隐身&quot;，帧指针照样可能被改（取决于布局）。四是只改代码不跑工具：这种 bug 在小样本上可能&quot;看起来正常&quot;，必须用 ASan 或边界检查才能稳定发现。</p>\n","answerHtml":"<p>buf 从 %rbp-8 开始，i=8 时写的是保存的旧 %rbp 的最低字节（小端最低地址）并置 0；若旧 %rbp 为 0x00007fffffffe4a0，则变成 0x00007fffffffe400，帧指针下移 0xa0=160 字节；开 canary 后该字节变成 canary 最低字节，而 canary 最低位本来就是 0x00，写入 0 不变，检查发现不了</p>\n"}